<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52285" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰκόπαθ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακοπαθής</span>
			, <i>miserable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					8.83
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>troublesome, laborious</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατασκευή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					<u>Bel.</u>
					56.46
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταλλεῖαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Posidon.
					48
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i> (cod. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				187.24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of persons,
				<i>laborious, persevering</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυνή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Muson.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					3p.11H.
				</span></i>
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
